简体中文

1. 适用范围
本协议适用于本目录中的协议定义、SDK、开发工具、示例、脚本及文档
（以下统称“开发包”）。开发包属于专有软件；公开源码不代表开源授权。
第三方组件继续适用各自的许可条款。

2. 非商业使用
在遵守本协议的前提下，凡泰极客允许您免费复制、编译和修改开发包，
用于非商业用途的插件开发、测试和使用。您可以为非商业用途分发所开发的
插件；其中包含的开发包代码及其修改版本必须保留本协议和版权声明。
本协议不转移您独立编写的插件代码的所有权。

3. 商业使用须另行授权
将开发包或基于开发包开发的插件用于任何商业用途前，必须事先取得
凡泰极客的书面许可。商业用途包括销售或收费分发插件、将插件集成到
商业产品，以及通过插件提供商业服务。插件免费分发不自动免除商业用途
的授权要求。非商业开发、测试或评估不授予后续商用权利。
商用范围和条件以双方另行达成的书面许可为准。

4. 与个人版免费使用的关系
FinShield 个人版按其产品条款免费使用。个人版免费使用不代表获得
本开发包或相关插件的商用授权。本协议不更改个人版或企业版产品条款，
也不授权分发 FinShield 私有引擎源码。

5. 其他条款与联系
除本协议明确授予的权利外，凡泰极客保留其他权利。在适用法律允许的
范围内，开发包按现状提供，不附带任何明示或默示保证。
商业授权申请及许可问题请联系：contact@finogeeks.com。

English

1. Scope
This license covers the protocol definitions, SDK, developer tools, examples,
scripts and documentation in this directory (the "Kit"). The Kit is proprietary
software. Public source availability does not grant an open-source license.
Third-party components remain subject to their respective licenses.

2. Noncommercial use
Subject to this license, Finogeeks permits you to copy, compile and modify the
Kit free of charge for noncommercial plugin development, testing and use. You
may distribute the plugins you develop for noncommercial purposes. Any included
Kit code and modifications to it must retain this license and copyright notice.
This license does not transfer ownership of your independently authored plugin code.

3. Separate permission for commercial use
Before using the Kit or plugins developed with it for any commercial purpose,
you must obtain prior written permission from Finogeeks. Commercial purposes
include selling or distributing plugins for a fee, integrating plugins into
commercial products, and providing commercial services through plugins.
Distributing a plugin free of charge does not automatically exempt its
commercial use from this requirement. Noncommercial development, testing or
evaluation does not grant subsequent commercial-use rights. Commercial scope
and conditions are governed by a separate written license between the parties.

4. Relationship to free Personal Edition use
FinShield Personal Edition is free to use under its product terms. Free use of
Personal Edition does not grant commercial-use rights for the Kit or related
plugins. This license does not change Personal or Enterprise Edition product
terms or authorize distribution of private FinShield engine source code.

5. Other terms and contact
Finogeeks reserves all rights not expressly granted by this license. To the
extent permitted by applicable law, the Kit is provided as is, without any
express or implied warranty. For commercial permission and license questions,
contact contact@finogeeks.com.
